{
  "message": "Based on the promotional offers I can verify, the EcoCard currently has the clearest sign-up bonus: spend $5,000 in eligible purchases within your first month and earn 2,000 sustainability points, worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking-account credit. It has a $50 annual fee, a 19.99% purchase APR on carried balances, and no minimum credit-score requirement. The bonus is awarded after the qualifying period closes.",
  "recommendation": "If your top priority is the sign-up bonus, the EcoCard is the strongest documented option. However, earning the bonus requires substantial first-month spending, and the $20 reward is less than the $50 annual fee unless you also value its ongoing sustainability rewards.",
  "important_note": "I could not verify comparable current sign-up bonus amounts for the other Rho-Bank cards from the available offer information, so I cannot reliably claim that the EcoCard is the best across every card without additional current offer details."
}
